    41	
    42	Default 64 KiB per key. Over-cap writes raise `StateStoreValueTooLarge`
    43	(NOT fail-open — the caller asked for an impossible guarantee). The
    44	cap exists because state stores are not designed for blob storage;
    45	bulk data belongs in a separate file with its own retention policy.
