     8	## Purpose
     9	
    10	Replace the `sys.path.insert(0, ...)` scatter in 91 test files with a
    11	single pytest-level path fixup. After this lands + 7-day soak on
    12	main, **Phase 5b** retires every `sys.path.insert` call across the
    13	hook test tree.
