    16	provides the same service for the scripts test tree.
    17	
    18	## Migration contract
    19	
    20	1. `validate.yml` must switch the hook-test step runner from
    21	   `python3 -m unittest discover .claude/hooks/tests/` →
    22	   `python3 -m pytest .claude/hooks/tests/ -q`. See staged patch at
    23	   `.claude/plans/PLAN-050/staged-code/validate_yml_pytest_migration.md`.
    24	2. Before removing any `sys.path.insert` from a test file, capture
    25	   the `__file__`-resolved paths and assert they match after removal.
    26	3. Ship-criterion: `grep -rn 'sys.path.insert' .claude/hooks/tests`
    27	   returns 0 hits AND pytest + unittest discover both green.
    28	4. Baseline hooks/tests collection = 3.4s → gate = ≤5.4s.
    29	
    30	## Proof-of-equivalence
    31	
    32	Before removing the first sys.path.insert:
    33	
    34	    python3 -m pytest .claude/hooks/tests/ --collect-only -q | sort > before.txt
    35	
    36	After the conftest lands:
    37	
    38	    python3 -m pytest .claude/hooks/tests/ --collect-only -q | sort > after.txt
    39	    diff before.txt after.txt  # must be empty
