   500	      # Explicit positive-control paths (the plan asks for them even though
   501	      # hooks/tests/ is dir-collected by the hook-tests-python-matrix job —
   502	      # PLAN-186 W4a): the Stop-review gate + the advisory-teeth chain-scan,
