   504	      # FUNCTIONAL self-test that the RED-on-absence teeth exit non-zero on a
   505	      # synthetic chain with tool activity but no boot breadcrumb (a
   506	      # fail-open rail's silence is NOT health -- the teeth must bite in CI).
