   985	      # covers this step like every other. Exit contract: 0 in-sync /
   986	      # 1 drift / 2 unusable input (missing file, missing `_derivation`)
   987	      # — ANY non-zero fails this step, fail-closed by design: a spec the
   988	      # generator cannot read is not a pass.
   989	      # -----------------------------------------------------------------
   990	      - name: User-template derivation (PLAN-169 F — regen+diff)
