  1330	  # PLAN-020 Phase 0 item 6b — opus-4-7-profiler-smoke job
  1331	  # ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1332	  # Runs `.claude/scripts/profile-opus-4-7.py --smoke` on every push + PR.
  1333	  # Synthetic mode (no Anthropic API call); ≤30s budget.
  1334	  # Catches regressions in:
  1335	  #  - Gate-boot file presence (CLAUDE.md + PROTOCOL.md + team.md +
  1336	  #    frontend-team.md + ceo-orchestration SKILL.md)
