 - [`docs/FUNCTION-LENGTH-POLICY.md`](FUNCTION-LENGTH-POLICY.md) — 50-LoC convention + `# justified:` syntax
 - [`docs/UPGRADE-PROCEDURE.md`](UPGRADE-PROCEDURE.md) — version-bump playbook
 
